      "changes": [
        "Trace the complementary physical region on every good copy and all bad physical copies, using the chosen Finset.equivFin enumeration. The result is the finite Kronecker power of the original one-copy regional marginal tensored with the literal whole-auxiliary marginal of the same actual excitation component. Only the prescribed one-copy vector is unit; zero components/copies and empty good sets are included. Auxiliary restriction, symmetry and merge moments remain separate."
